          {
            "title": "Question: Properties",
            "id": 84642,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu nesnedeki <code>make</code> ve <code>model</code> için ne ad kullanırız?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" car = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"make\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Toyota&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"model\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Camry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nesnenin özellikleri</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nesnenin değerleri</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nesnenin parametreleri</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nesnenin özellikleri.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Görüntülenen nesnede <code>Toyota</code> ve <code>Camry</code> değerlerdir. <code>make</code> ve <code>model</code> nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" car = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"make\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Toyota&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"model\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Camry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Özellikler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parametreler</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Metotlar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Özellikler öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Properties",
            "id": 84655,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>car</code> nesnesine <code>2020</code> değerine sahip <code>year</code> özelliğini ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" car = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"make\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Toyota&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"model\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Camry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\" : \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;year&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>year</code>, ardından <code>:</code> ve son olarak <code>2020</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>car</code> nesnesine model yılını ekleyerek <code>year</code> özelliğine <code>2020</code> sayısını ata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"car\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"make\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Toyota'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"model\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Camry'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'2020'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"years\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>year</code>, ardından <code>:</code> ve son olarak <code>2020</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Accessing Properties",
            "id": 85137,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nesnenin <code>make</code> özelliğini görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" car = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"make\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Toyota&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"model\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Camry&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(car.make);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"70\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Toyota\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>car.make</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Updating Properties",
            "id": 85370,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>console.log(home.style);</code> ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" home = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"style\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tudor&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bedrooms\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"home.style = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cape Cod&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(home.style);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Cape Cod\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Cape Cod</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Tudor</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[\"Cape Cod\", \"Tudor\"]</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>Cape Cod Tudor</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Cape Cod</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nesne başlangıçta <code>Tudor</code> stiline sahip, ardından sonraki satır yeni bir stil atıyor. Konsol ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" home = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"style\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tudor&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bedrooms\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"home.style = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cape Cod&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(home.style);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Cape Cod\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cape Cod</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tudor</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Her iki stili bir dizide</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">undefined</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cape Cod öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Updating Properties",
            "id": 85257,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kodda <code>pet.animal = \"cat\";</code> satırı ne yapar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"animal\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;dog&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pet.animal = \" /><text value=\"&quot;cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nesnenin <code>animal</code> özelliğinin değerini <code>\"dog\"</code> değerinden <code>\"cat\"</code> değerine değiştirir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir şey</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><strong>Yeni</strong> bir <code>animal</code> özelliği oluşturur; değeri <code>\"cat\"</code> olur</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Nesnenin <code>animal</code> özelliğini <code>[\"dog\", \"cat\"]</code> dizisine ayarlar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nesnenin <code>animal</code> özelliğinin değerini <code>\"dog\"</code> değerinden <code>\"cat\"</code> değerine değiştirir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu koddan sonra <code>pet.name = \"Milo\";</code> çalıştırıyorsun. <code>pet</code> şimdi hangi özellik değeri çiftini içerir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"animal\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;dog&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sunny&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pet.animal = \" /><text value=\"&quot;cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">animal değeri cat; name değeri Milo.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">animal değeri dog; name değeri Milo.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">animal değeri Milo; name değeri Sunny.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">animal değeri cat; name değeri Sunny.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">animal değeri cat; name değeri Milo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Creating Methods",
            "id": 85329,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nesnenin metodunu oluşturacak kodu birleştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" microwave = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"brand\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Samsung&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"heat\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"method\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>heat</code>, ardından <code>:</code> ve sonra <code>function</code>, <code>()</code>, <code>{}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mikrodalga nesnesinde <code>heat</code> metodunu oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"microwave\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"brand\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Samsung'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"heat\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"method\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>heat</code>, ardından <code>:</code>, <code>function</code>, <code>()</code> ve son olarak <code>{}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Calling Methods",
            "id": 85332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hangi kod, bir <code>mouse</code> nesnesine <code>squeak</code> adlı bir metodu çalıştırmasını söyler?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>mouse.squeak();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>mouse.squeak;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>mouse:squeak();</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>mouse.squeak();</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>mouse</code> nesnesinin bir <code>squeak</code> metodu var. Hangi satır bu metodu şimdi çalıştırır?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>mouse.squeak();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>mouse.squeak;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>mouse:squeak();</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>mouse = squeak();</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>mouse.squeak();</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Similar to Functions",
            "id": 85326,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>isOn</code> metodunun <code>true</code> değerini <code>return</code> etmesi için eksik anahtar kelimeyi ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" microwave = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"brand\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Samsung&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isOn\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"67\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Getting properties with \"this\"",
            "id": 85497,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir metot içinden bir nesneye başvurmak için hangi anahtar kelimeyi kullanırız?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>this</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>that</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">nesne adı</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>this</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir nesne metodunun içinde, aynı nesnedeki başka bir özelliği hangi anahtar sözcükle okuyabilirsin?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>this</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>that</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>object</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>this</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Getting properties with \"this\"",
            "id": 85496,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodu, <code>isOn</code> metodunun <code>on</code> özelliğinin değerini <code>return</code> etmesini sağlayacak şekilde tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" microwave = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"brand\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Samsung&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"on\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isOn\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".on;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"microwave\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>this</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>on</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>isOn</code> metodunun, içinde bulunduğu nesneyi belirten anahtar kelimeyle mikrodalganın <code>on</code> değerini döndürmesini sağla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"microwave\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"brand\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Samsung'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"on\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isOn\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"on\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"microwave\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"self\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>this</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>on</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: JSON.parse",
            "id": 120538,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsol çıktısı ne olacak?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flower = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;tulip&quot;, &quot;petals&quot;: 30, &quot;city&quot;: &quot;Amsterdam&quot;}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flowerConversion = \" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(flower);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(flowerConversion.name);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"tulip\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>tulip</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Error</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>'{\"name\": \"tulip\", \"petals\": 30, \"city\": \"Amsterdam\"}'</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>tulip</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>JSON.parse</code> çiçek dizesini dönüştürdükten sonra <code>flowerConversion.name</code> hangi değeri seçer?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flower = \" /><text value=\"'{&quot;name&quot;: &quot;tulip&quot;, &quot;petals&quot;: 30, &quot;city&quot;: &quot;Amsterdam&quot;}'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" flowerConversion = \" /><text value=\"JSON\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".parse(flower);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(flowerConversion.name);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"tulip\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">tulip</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Amsterdam</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Orijinal JSON dizesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">tulip öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: JSON.stringify",
            "id": 120539,
